      ⍝ before ever reaching the "attempt to create a lambda" one this
      ⍝ test is actually about.
      ⍝
      ⎕FX'λ←Test W ;C;D ⍝⍝ π times ΣW' 'λ←○+/W'
DEFN ERROR+
      ⎕FX 'λ←Test W ;C;D ⍝⍝ π times ΣW' 'λ←○+/W'
      ^

      )MORE
Attempt (of ⎕FX) to create or edit a lambda. Use { ... } instead.

